    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The dissident gains 1/2 of a combat, magic, or skill talent per level, according to Table: Dissident. In addition, she gains a utility talent that can be spent on combat, magic, or skill talents at every odd level. Dissidents use their casting ability modifier as their practitioner and operative modifier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/dissident#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
